WEBVTT

00:09.200 --> 00:10.667
- ARE YOU READY, KIDS?
- 孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:10.667 --> 00:12.467
all: AYE, AYE, CAPTAIN!
所有人：是，是，队长！

00:12.467 --> 00:13.933
- I CAN'T HEAR YOU.
- 我听不到你说话。

00:13.933 --> 00:15.733
all: AYE, AYE, CAPTAIN!
所有人：是，是，队长！

00:15.733 --> 00:18.767
- * OHH...
-*哦...

00:18.767 --> 00:21.033
* WHO LIVES IN A PINEAPPLE
UNDER THE SEA? *
*谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ *

00:21.033 --> 00:23.033
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
所有：海绵宝宝！

00:23.033 --> 00:25.100
- * ABSORBENT AND YELLOW
AND POROUS IS HE *
- * 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的*

00:25.100 --> 00:26.767
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
所有：海绵宝宝！

00:26.767 --> 00:29.100
- * IF NAUTICAL NONSENSE
BE SOMETHING YOU WISH *
- * 如果是航海废话
成为您所希望的*

00:29.100 --> 00:30.600
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
所有：海绵宝宝！

00:30.600 --> 00:33.067
- * THEN DROP ON THE DECK
AND FLOP LIKE A FISH *
- * 然后掉到甲板上
像鱼一样扑腾*

00:33.067 --> 00:35.000
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
- READY?
所有：海绵宝宝！
- 准备好？

00:35.000 --> 00:37.033
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
所有：海绵宝宝！

00:37.033 --> 00:38.967
SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
海绵宝宝！

00:38.967 --> 00:40.933
SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
海绵宝宝！

00:40.933 --> 00:42.167
- SPONGEBOB
- 海绵宝宝

00:42.167 --> 00:44.467
SQUAREPANTS!
方裤！

00:44.467 --> 00:46.933
[laughing]
[笑]

00:46.933 --> 00:49.233
