01:05.867 --> 01:08.233
- A LITTLE MORE SAND.
- 再多一点沙子。

01:08.233 --> 01:10.767
PAT, PAT, PAT.
拍，拍，拍。

01:10.767 --> 01:13.467
PAT, PAT,
PATRICK!
帕特，帕特，
帕特里克！

01:13.467 --> 01:14.533
CHECK IT OUT.
一探究竟。

01:14.533 --> 01:17.367
AN EXACT REPLICA
OF THE KRUSTY KRAB.
精确复制品
甲壳蟹的。

01:17.367 --> 01:22.067
ONE SANDY PATTY,
EXTRA GRIT.
一块沙馅饼，
额外的砂砾。

01:22.067 --> 01:25.200
- [gulps]
A BIT DRY AND FLAVORLESS.
- [吞咽]
有点干而且无味。

01:25.200 --> 01:26.600
I'LL TAKE TWO DOZEN.
我要两打。

01:26.600 --> 01:27.700
- HEY, EVERYONE.
- 嘿，大家。

01:27.700 --> 01:29.700
THE DRASTIC RADICALS
ARE TEARING IT UP
极端激进分子
正在撕毁它

01:29.700 --> 01:30.867
ON SAND MOUNTAIN.
在沙山上。

01:30.867 --> 01:33.633
- OH, JOHNNY, JOHNNY!
- OH, JOHNNY!
- 哦，约翰尼，约翰尼！
- 哦，约翰尼！

01:33.633 --> 01:35.400
- LET'S CHECK IT OUT.
- 我们来看看。

01:35.400 --> 01:37.567
- UM,
COULD YOU GIVE ME A HAND?
- 嗯，
你能帮我一下吗？

01:37.567 --> 01:39.067
- SURE THING, BUDDY.
- 当然可以，伙计。

01:39.067 --> 01:40.400
- [whistles]
- [口哨]

01:44.700 --> 01:47.733
[excited chatter]
[兴奋的喋喋不休]

01:47.733 --> 01:49.300
- I CAN'T SEE ANYTHING.
- 我什么也看不见。

01:49.300 --> 01:53.067
- ALLOW ME.
- 请允许我。

01:53.067 --> 01:54.867
[engine revs ]
[发动机转速]

01:54.867 --> 01:56.133
[crowd gasps]
[人群喘息]

02:00.633 --> 02:04.600
- YEAHHH!
- 是啊！

02:04.600 --> 02:07.667
[laughs]
[笑]

02:12.567 --> 02:14.167
- WOW.
- WHOA.
- 哇。
- 哇哦。

02:14.167 --> 02:15.733
- WHOA.
- WOW.
- 哇哦。
- 哇。

02:15.733 --> 02:17.067
- WOW.
- WOW.
- 哇。
- 哇。

02:17.067 --> 02:18.433
- WHOA.
- WHOA.
- 哇哦。
- 哇哦。

02:23.067 --> 02:24.400
[bugle call]
[号角]

02:24.400 --> 02:27.200
- [gasps]
LOOK OUT!
- [喘气]
当心！

02:27.200 --> 02:29.300
- [laughs]
- [笑]

02:31.067 --> 02:32.567
- SOMEONE HELP
THAT LITTLE OLD LADY!
- 有人帮忙
那个小老太太！

02:32.567 --> 02:36.100
- HELP YOURSELVES, NIMRODS!
- 救救自己吧，宁罗德！

02:36.100 --> 02:39.100
[rock music]
[摇滚乐]

02:39.100 --> 02:47.067
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

02:52.633 --> 02:54.100
[explosion]
[爆炸]

02:54.100 --> 02:59.200
- [screaming laughter]
- [尖叫的笑声]

02:59.200 --> 03:00.433
[engine revs ]
[发动机转速]

03:00.433 --> 03:03.067
- JOHNNY KRILL!
- 约翰尼·克里尔！

03:03.067 --> 03:05.600
NOT DEAD TED!
没有死！

03:05.600 --> 03:07.267
- [laughs]
- [笑]

03:07.267 --> 03:10.467
- GRAND MAUL GRANNY!
- 大槌奶奶！

03:10.467 --> 03:12.133
[explosion]
[爆炸]

03:12.133 --> 03:14.233
DRASTIC...
剧烈...

03:14.233 --> 03:16.633
RADICALS!
激进分子！

03:16.633 --> 03:18.333
[explosion]
[爆炸]

03:18.333 --> 03:20.900
THE DRASTICALS!
激进派！

03:20.900 --> 03:22.767
- DID YOU SEE THAT?
- 你看到了吗？

03:22.767 --> 03:26.167
both: WHAT WAS THAT?
两人：那是什么？

03:26.167 --> 03:28.467
- WHY, THOSE AWE
THE DWASTIC WADICALS,
- 为什么，那些敬畏
DWASTIC WADICALS，

03:28.467 --> 03:32.467
THE NUMBEW ONE PWACTITIONERS
OF EXTWEME SPOWTS.
排名第一的参与者
EXTWEME 景点。

03:32.467 --> 03:34.500
[slurps]
[啜饮]

03:34.500 --> 03:36.733
both: EXTREME WHAT?
两者：极端什么？

03:36.733 --> 03:41.167
- EXTREME SPOWTS...
- 极限点...

03:41.167 --> 03:43.567
- EXTREME SPOTS?
- 极端地点？

03:43.567 --> 03:44.900
WELL, THAT'S NO FAIR.
嗯，这不公平。

03:44.900 --> 03:48.300
YOU'RE ALREADY COVERED
IN EXTREME SPOTS.
您已经得到保障
在极端地点。

03:48.300 --> 03:51.100
OOH.
HOLD ON A SECOND.
哦。
请稍等。

03:51.100 --> 03:53.800
[hive buzzing]
[蜂巢嗡嗡声]

04:02.233 --> 04:04.567
[screaming,
electricity crackling]
[尖叫，
电噼啪声]

04:04.567 --> 04:07.600
OKAY, LET'S GO MEET
OUR NEW HEROES.
好的，我们去见面吧
我们的新英雄。

04:07.600 --> 04:09.600
[laughing]
[笑]

04:09.600 --> 04:11.867
- WE WANT TO JOIN
YOUR EXTREME SPOTS TEAM.
- 我们想加入
您的极限地点团队。

04:11.867 --> 04:14.067
AS YOU CAN SEE,
WE'RE ALSO COVERED HEAD TO TOE
如您所见，
我们也从头到脚都做好了防护

04:14.067 --> 04:15.700
IN THE MOST EXTREME OF SPOTS.
在最极端的地方。

04:15.700 --> 04:16.967
- ITCHY SPOTS.
- 发痒的地方。

04:16.967 --> 04:19.800
[all cackling]
[全都咯咯笑]

04:19.800 --> 04:21.233
- YOU'RE KIDDING ME.
- 你在开玩笑吧。

04:21.233 --> 04:22.500
- OH, NO.
OH, NO, STOP.
- 哦，不。
哦，不，停下来。

04:22.500 --> 04:24.067
STOP.
[laughs]
停止。
[笑]

04:24.067 --> 04:26.900
EXTREME SPOTS.
[laughs]
极端地点。
[笑]

04:26.900 --> 04:30.467
IT'S EXTREME "SPORTS,"
NOT "SPOTS."
这是极限“运动”，
不是“斑点”。

04:30.467 --> 04:32.800
SO, YOU WANT TO BE
A DRASTICAL?
所以，你想成为
激进的？

04:32.800 --> 04:35.067
LET'S SEE WHAT YOU GOT,
LITTLE DUDE.
让我们看看你得到了什么，
小家伙。

04:35.067 --> 04:36.167
- NO PROBLEMO.
- 没问题。

04:36.167 --> 04:37.867
I GUESS YOU JUST HOP UP
LIKE THIS...
我猜你只是跳起来
像这样...

04:37.867 --> 04:39.100
[engine revs ]
[发动机转速]

04:39.100 --> 04:40.100
[tires screech]
[轮胎尖叫声]

04:40.100 --> 04:41.100
HEY!
嘿！

04:41.100 --> 04:42.367
COME BACK!
回来！

04:42.367 --> 04:43.900
[engine revs ]
[发动机转速]

04:43.900 --> 04:46.833
HEY!
嘿！

04:49.533 --> 04:51.900
[screams]
[尖叫声]

04:51.900 --> 04:54.633
OH!
哦！

04:54.633 --> 04:56.733
[groans]
[呻吟]

04:57.800 --> 04:59.433
- [laughs]
- [笑]

04:59.433 --> 05:02.067
YOUR TURN, FAT BOY.
轮到你了，胖男孩。

05:02.067 --> 05:05.333
- HEY, HOW'D WE GET UP HERE?
- 嘿，我们怎么到这里来？

05:05.333 --> 05:08.233
[screams]
[尖叫声]

05:08.233 --> 05:10.167
[gulps]
[吞咽]

05:10.167 --> 05:12.167
[seal barks]
[海豹吠叫]

05:12.167 --> 05:13.867
[horn honks]
[喇叭鸣响]

05:13.867 --> 05:14.867
[dolphin whistles]
[海豚哨声]

05:14.867 --> 05:15.800
[crash]
[碰撞]

05:17.267 --> 05:18.267
[duck quacks]
[鸭子嘎嘎叫]

05:18.267 --> 05:19.433
[screams]
[尖叫声]

05:19.433 --> 05:20.700
[thud]
OOH!
[砰]
哦！

05:20.700 --> 05:23.767
- OUR SPORTS ARE TOO EXTREME
FOR YOU DUDES.
- 我们的运动太极限了
为了你们伙计们。

05:23.767 --> 05:26.100
MAYBE WE SHOULD START YOU TWO
ON SOMETHING EASIER.
也许我们应该让你们两个开始
做一些更简单的事情。

05:26.100 --> 05:29.200
WHAT GAMES DO YOU DUDES
LIKE TO PLAY?
你们都玩什么游戏
喜欢玩吗？

05:29.200 --> 05:30.433
- OH, I KNOW.
- 哦，我知道。

05:30.433 --> 05:33.433
HOW ABOUT A LITTLE SOMETHING
CALLED JUMP ROPE?
来一点怎么样
叫跳绳？

05:33.433 --> 05:36.500
- JUMP ROPE, EH?
DEMONSTRATE.
- 跳绳，呃？
证明。

05:36.500 --> 05:37.500
- READY, PATRICK?
- 准备好了吗，帕特里克？

05:37.500 --> 05:40.400
ON YOUR MARK, GET SET,
各就各位，准备好，

05:40.400 --> 05:41.500
JUMP ROPE!
跳绳！

05:41.500 --> 05:43.533
- EXTREME!
- 极端！

05:43.533 --> 05:46.900
HEY, WHO'S HOLDING
THE OTHER END?
嘿，谁在持有
另一端？

05:46.900 --> 05:48.567
- I AM, OF COURSE.
- 我是，当然。

05:48.567 --> 05:49.567
- WHOA.
- HI, PATRICK.
- 哇哦。
- 嗨，帕特里克。

05:49.567 --> 05:50.633
- AH.
- 啊。

05:50.633 --> 05:52.067
[plays harmonica]
[吹口琴]

05:52.067 --> 05:54.167
* MY BEST FRIEND IS SPONGEBOB
- SING IT.
* 我最好的朋友是海绵宝宝
- 唱吧。

05:54.167 --> 05:56.133
- * HE HAS A SQUARE HEAD
- YEAH!
- * 他有一个方头
- 是啊！

05:56.133 --> 05:59.067
- * I TRY ON HIS CLOTHES
WHILE HE'S ASLEEP IN BED *
- * 我试穿他的衣服
当他在床上睡着时*

05:59.067 --> 06:00.233
- WOW--WHAT?
- 哇——什么？

06:00.233 --> 06:02.233
- [panting]
- [气喘吁吁]

06:02.233 --> 06:03.567
IT'S WEIRD.
这很奇怪。

06:03.567 --> 06:05.500
MY FACE IS LEAKING.
我的脸漏水了。

06:05.500 --> 06:06.900
- YOUR FACE ISN'T LEAKING.
- 你的脸没有漏水。

06:06.900 --> 06:09.067
YOU'RE JUST SWEATING
FROM ALL THE EXERCISE.
你只是出汗了
来自所有的锻炼。

06:09.067 --> 06:10.300
- EXERCISE?
- 锻炼？

06:10.300 --> 06:12.967
OOH, I DIDN'T SIGN UP
FOR THIS.
哦，我没有注册
为此。

06:12.967 --> 06:14.900
[pants]
OH.
[裤子]
哦。

06:14.900 --> 06:16.933
- EXTREME.
- 极端。

06:16.933 --> 06:19.700
- DUDE, THAT WAS NOT EXTREME.
- 老兄，这并不极端。

06:19.700 --> 06:21.933
NOW LET THE DRASTICALS
SHOW YOU HOW IT'S DONE.
现在让激进分子
向您展示它是如何完成的。

06:21.933 --> 06:24.167
GRAB IT, GRANNY.
抓住它，奶奶。

06:26.067 --> 06:27.067
- [panting]
- [气喘吁吁]

06:32.767 --> 06:35.133
DRASTICALS! WOW!
激进派！哇！

06:35.133 --> 06:37.600
YEAH!
是的！

06:40.200 --> 06:43.767
- KICK IT UP A NOTCH.
- 更上一层楼。

06:43.767 --> 06:47.833
both: OOH.
两人：哦。

06:47.833 --> 06:49.833
- YEAH!
- 是的！

06:49.833 --> 06:50.767
[thud]
[砰]

06:52.600 --> 06:55.400
[screams]
[尖叫声]

06:55.400 --> 06:57.233
[small explosion]
[小爆炸]

06:57.233 --> 06:59.133
- YEAH!
SEE?
- 是的！
看？

06:59.133 --> 07:02.067
EXTREME SPORTS
SHOULD BE EXPLOSIVE. BOOM!
极限运动
应该是爆炸性的。繁荣！

07:02.067 --> 07:05.400
- EXPLOSIVE, HUH?
I KNOW JUST THE THING.
- 爆炸，嗯？
我只知道这件事。

07:05.400 --> 07:06.400
[inhales]
[吸气]

07:06.400 --> 07:08.667
[blows air]
[吹气]

07:08.667 --> 07:10.067
BOOM!
繁荣！

07:10.067 --> 07:11.300
- POW!
- KAZAM!
- 战俘！
- 卡赞！

07:11.300 --> 07:12.300
- BLOOEY!
- WHOOSH!
- 哎呀！
- 嗖嗖！

07:12.300 --> 07:14.067
- BIFF!
- IMPRESSED?
- 比夫！
- 印象深刻吗？

07:14.067 --> 07:15.767
all: NO.
全体：没有。

07:15.767 --> 07:16.833
- LOOK, DUDES.
- 看，伙计们。

07:16.833 --> 07:19.067
TO BE EXTREME,
YOU GOT TO GO BIGGER.
变得极端，
你必须做得更大。

07:19.067 --> 07:20.200
SHOW 'EM, DRASTICALS.
让他们看看，激进派。

07:20.200 --> 07:22.300
[rock music]
[摇滚乐]

07:22.300 --> 07:24.400
[splashing]
[溅]

07:24.400 --> 07:31.600
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

07:31.600 --> 07:33.067
WATCH THIS.
注意这个。

07:33.067 --> 07:34.067
[engine revs ]
[发动机转速]

07:38.067 --> 07:40.467
[engine revs ]
[发动机转速]

07:43.100 --> 07:44.133
- HOLY CHUM!
- 天哪！

07:44.133 --> 07:46.267
[panicked screaming]
[惊慌尖叫]

07:46.267 --> 07:48.067
[engine revs ]
[发动机转速]

07:51.833 --> 07:53.633
[crash]
[碰撞]

07:53.633 --> 07:56.467
- EXTREME.
- 极端。

07:58.400 --> 07:59.567
HUP.
HUP。
HUP。
胡普。

07:59.567 --> 08:01.700
NOW THAT'S
HOW YOU DO EXTREME.
现在就是这样
你如何做到极限。

08:01.700 --> 08:02.700
DO YOU UNDERSTAND?
你明白吗？

08:02.700 --> 08:05.533
- I THINK I DO.
IS FIGHTING EXTREME?
- 我想我愿意。
战斗是否极端？

08:05.533 --> 08:08.133
- FIGHTING IS TOTALLY EXTREME.
- 战斗完全是极端的。

08:09.333 --> 08:11.067
- I WANT A CLEAN FIGHT.
- 我想要一场干净的战斗。

08:11.067 --> 08:14.067
I DON'T WANT TO SEE ANY TRASH
LAYING AROUND.
我不想看到任何垃圾
躺在周围。

08:15.467 --> 08:16.367
[groans]
[呻吟]

08:19.833 --> 08:21.067
[screams]
[尖叫声]

08:21.067 --> 08:23.100
WHOA!
哇啊！

08:23.100 --> 08:25.633
[muffled screaming]
[低沉的尖叫声]

08:25.633 --> 08:27.733
- OH...
- 哦...

08:27.733 --> 08:30.333
WE GIVE UP!
FLING.
我们放弃！
一扔。

08:30.333 --> 08:33.100
[birds chirping]
[鸟鸣声]

08:33.100 --> 08:35.833
THAT WAS CLOSE.
- NOT SO FAST.
已经很接近了。
- 没那么快。

08:35.833 --> 08:38.600
THAT'S NOT FIGHTING.
这不是打架。

08:38.600 --> 08:41.300
STAND ASIDE.
站到一边。

08:41.300 --> 08:42.767
I'LL SHOW YOU HOW IT'S DONE.
我将向您展示它是如何完成的。

08:42.767 --> 08:44.933
[grunts]
[咕哝]

08:46.967 --> 08:48.067
[machine rumbles]
[机器隆隆声]

08:48.067 --> 08:50.533
- NO!
IT'S DRY CLEAN-ONLY.
- 不！
只能干洗。

08:50.533 --> 08:51.900
[rumbling]
[隆隆声]

08:51.900 --> 08:53.067
[crash]
[碰撞]

08:55.667 --> 08:56.700
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

08:56.700 --> 08:58.600
[weakly]
AVENGE ME.
[微弱]
为我报仇。

08:58.600 --> 08:59.800
[moans]
OH.
[呻吟声]
哦。

08:59.800 --> 09:03.167
- OH.
- BRUTAL.
- 哦。
- 残酷。

09:03.167 --> 09:04.700
- CHARLIE?
- 查理？

09:04.700 --> 09:06.800
[growls]
[咆哮]

09:09.433 --> 09:10.767
[birds chirping]
[鸟鸣声]

09:12.167 --> 09:14.600
- OOH.
- EVEN MORE BRUTAL!
-哦。
